      "id": "W7221004667",
      "doi": "10.1364/ol.614054",
      "title": "Sensing pulse-synchronous temporal entropy loading technique for co-wavelength optical fiber ISAC system",
      "authors": [
        "Meng Xiang",
        "Zhang Bingbing",
        "weitao zheng",
        "Liu Jiacai",
        "Songnian Fu",
        "Yuwen Qin"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Letters",
      "venue_abbr": "OL",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "pulse synchronization",
        "integrated sensing and communication",
        "fiber optic sensing",
        "optical fiber communication"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.614054",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/01c70d6b-5cf4-427e-9e7c-f92b157e93ff.html",
      "summary": "论文提出感知脉冲同步时间熵加载（SP-TEL），为与感知脉冲重叠和不重叠的概率星座整形通信符号分配不同熵，以适应脉冲引起的时变信道。摘要报告在10.91 km标准单模光纤上的40 GBaud四子载波PCS-DP-64QAM同波长通感系统中进行了实验验证。相比均匀熵方案，GMI提升0.2 bit/symbol，在目标GMI为4.6 bit/symbol时，所需OSNR最多降低3 dB；同时实现1 kHz振动定位，空间分辨率为10 m，振动信噪比为30.04 dB。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
